{28}{Me want talk bout somethin else.}{}{-4}{}{1}{}
{29}{Let's discuss another topic.}{}{5}{}{1}{}
{30}{My name is Ares Quick. I'm an information systems specialist by trade.}{My name is Ares Quick. I'm an information systems specialist by trade.}{}{}{}{}
{31}{That's right. Let me ask you something else...}{}{5}{}{20}{}
{32}{Me ask you sumtin else.}{}{-4}{}{20}{}
{35}{I was in coldsleep like you... oh that's right, you won't remember. Well, it might come back to you. In any case, there was some kind of major malfunction in the coldsleep clusters, a power surge. My coffin was activated and it ejected me immediately. When I came to, I wandered around for a bit in the Clusters- had to crawl through a vent out of the Recovery Room.}{I was in coldsleep like you... oh that's right, you won't remember. Well, it might come back to you. In any case, there was some kind of major malfunction in the coldsleep clusters, a power surge. My coffin was activated and it ejected me immediately. When I came to, I wandered around for a bit in the Clusters- had to crawl through a vent out of the Recovery Room.}{}{}{}{}
{36}{And then?}{}{5}{}{38}{}
{37}{Wut happen next?!?}{}{-4}{}{38}{}
{38}{Well, the elevator was busted, so I snuck through the residential area, and then crawled through the vent into the shafts down here. I explored a bit, but holed up in this room after a particularly nasty encounter.}{Well, the elevator was busted, so I snuck through the residential area, and then crawled through the vent into the shafts down here. I explored a bit, but holed up in this room after a particularly nasty encounter.}{}{}{}{}
{39}{What sort of encounter?}{}{5}{ru-1009 }{42}{}
{40}{A incowder???!?}{}{-4}{ru-1009 }{42}{}
{41}{Enough of this. Let's talk about something else.}{}{1}{}{1}{}
{42}{Around the corner and through the tunnels a bit, I found a storeroom that was all locked up. I also found a big spider robot that used a projected hologram as an ally in combat. The robot didn't seem too tough, but I was too afraid of it's holographic slave to attack. So I ran. It's still there, for all I know. Anyway, it looked like it had claimed a victim before me, because there was a dead body there.}{Around the corner and through the tunnels a bit, I found a storeroom that was all locked up. I also found a big spider robot that used a projected hologram as an ally in combat. The robot didn't seem too tough, but I was too afraid of it's holographic slave to attack. So I ran. It's still there, for all I know. Anyway, it looked like it had claimed a victim before me, because there was a dead body there.}{}{}{}{ru1009 1}
{43}{Hm. Let's talk about something else...}{}{1}{}{20}{}
{50}{I was a information systems specialist. Networking matrices, low-level router programming, protocol development. I was supposed to help rebuild the world's network infrastructure after the bomb.... ha!}{I was a information systems specialist. Networking matrices, low-level router programming, protocol development. I was supposed to help rebuild the world's network infrastructure after the bomb.... ha!}{}{}{}{}
{51}{Interesting. So you know a fair bit about computers, huh?}{}{5}{}{55}{}
{52}{Oh-ho, so you are mistar computar smarty man huh? }{}{-4}{}{55}{}
{55}{Yeah, I guess you could say that.}{Yeah, I guess you could say that.}{}{}{}{}
{56}{Let's talk about something else...}{}{1}{}{20}{}
{75}{I'm not sure, but I'll bet it's related the power surge into the Coldsleep Clusters. It could have done all kinds of things to your system. Who knows, maybe it will return with time...}{I'm not sure, but I'll bet it's related the power surge into the Coldsleep Clusters. It could have done all kinds of things to your system. Who knows, maybe it will return with time...}{}{}{}{}
{76}{Yes, I ran a diagnostic scan... it looks like some brain damage. It might heal, or it might not.}{}{5}{gf25 1}{85}{}
{77}{Interesting theory. Let's discuss something else...}{}{5}{}{1}{}
{78}{Uh... maybe. We talk bout somethin else.}{}{-4}{}{1}{}
{85}{That's terrible, but really, you're lucky to be alive. Did you want to talk about anything else?}{That's terrible, but really, you're lucky to be alive. Did you want to talk about anything else?}{}{}{}{lf6 1}
{86}{Yes.}{}{1}{}{1}{}
{87}{No.}{}{1}{}{0}{}
//Beginning of hostile dialog
{100}{You've burnt your bridges with me, sir. I suggest you find another place to hang about.}{You've burnt your bridges with me, ma'am. I suggest you find another place to hang about.}{}{}{}{}
{101}{Look, I'm really really sorry about this. We got off on the wrong foot...}{}{5}{ps4 ,lf0 0}{110}{lf1 0}
