{103}{Bye, then.}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{110}{Hm. Well, I apologize as well. It's been a little stressful hiding down here... So, will you tell me your story so far?}{Hm. Well, I apologize as well. It's been a little stressful hiding down here... So, will you tell me your story so far?}{}{}{}{}
{111}{[Tell him what has occurred since you regained consciousness.]}{}{1}{}{230}{}
