{135}{Bye.}{}{1}{}{0}{}
{150}{Well, I haven't ventured out to explore much yet- the robots are too dangerous. When we were all arriving to enter Coldsleep, things were too crazy to get much of a look around. Besides, all we got to see on the way in is the Ground Floor and the elevator shaft really, anyway.}{Well, I haven't ventured out to explore much yet- the robots are too dangerous. When we were all arriving to enter Coldsleep, things were too crazy to get much of a look around. Besides, all we got to see on the way in is the Ground Floor and the elevator shaft really, anyway.}{}{}{}{}
{151}{I understand... can you tell me what you have learned, then?}{}{5}{}{155}{}
{152}{Okie okie, me get it... so, you tell me what is around here?}{}{-4}{}{155}{}
{153}{Nevermind. Let me ask you about Deep15...}{}{1}{}{125}{}
{155}{Alright. Well, this area was mainly used for maintenance and storage as far as I can tell, so there are a couple of storerooms about. That elevator you might have noticed in the Coldsleep Clusters can take you up to levels 2, 3, and the Ground Level. There are also several different ventilation shafts scattered about that can take you to other areas... it's kind of a maze.}{Alright. Well, this area was mainly used for maintenance and storage as far as I can tell, so there are a couple of storerooms about. That elevator you might have noticed in the Coldsleep Clusters can take you up to levels 2, 3, and the Ground Level. There are also several different ventilation shafts scattered about that can take you to other areas... it's kind of a maze.}{}{}{}{}
{156}{Hm. Not very helpful.}{}{5}{}{125}{}
{157}{Uh. You no help.}{}{-4}{}{125}{}
