{215}{My name is Ares Quick. I assumed all of the inhabitants of this Deep World were either dead or fled. You seem to be neither. May I ask where you came from?}{My name is Ares Quick. I assumed all of the inhabitants of this Deep World were either dead or fled. You seem to be neither. May I ask where you came from?}{}{}{}{}
