{400}{[He glares at the mention of Liebert's name.] Ah. Yes, Well, I guess the conversation had to get around to this sooner or later, eh? He's the bastard that's got me hiding like a rat down here. Most of the personnel files and logs have been erased, I would assume by him, but from what I have cobbled together, he just took this place over from the staff and colonists a few weeks ago. I don't know if any of em are left, hiding out or whatnot, but this place feels... empty.}{[He glares at the mention of Liebert's name.] Ah. Yes, Well, I guess the conversation had to get around to this sooner or later, eh? He's the bastard that's got me hiding like a rat down here. Most of the personnel files and logs have been erased, I would assume by him, but from what I have cobbled together, he just took this place over from the staff and colonists a few weeks ago. I don't know if any of em are left, hiding out or whatnot, but this place feels... empty.}{}{}{}{}
{401}{Wow, that's a nasty turn of events. }{}{5}{}{420}{}
{402}{I don't see what that has to do with me.}{}{5}{}{415}{}
{403}{Oh, that sounds very very bad! }{}{-4}{}{420}{}
{404}{Me not care! That not my problem!}{}{-4}{}{415}{}
{415}{Well, it actually should be of very great significance to you, since Liebert's drones will undoubtedly kill you on sight just like they did to all the other humans here. And Liebert isn't letting anyone leave, either.}{Well, it actually should be of very great significance to you, since Liebert's drones will undoubtedly kill you on sight just like they did to all the other humans here. And Liebert isn't letting anyone leave, either.}{}{}{}{}
{416}{Can he be reasoned with?}{}{5}{}{430}{}
{417}{We talk him out of hurting us maybe?}{}{-4}{}{430}{}
{418}{Well, I think we need to get find a way out of here then!}{}{5}{}{440}{}
{419}{Okie den, we need to find a way out of here!}{}{-4}{}{440}{}
{420}{Indeed. His drones would most likely execute you on sight.}{Indeed. His drones would most likely execute you on sight.}{}{}{}{}
{421}{Can he be reasoned with?}{}{5}{}{430}{}
{422}{We talk him out of hurting us maybe?}{}{-4}{}{430}{}
{423}{Well, I think we need to get find a way out of here then!}{}{5}{}{440}{}
