{430}{I don't know. Even if there is a chance he may be willing to let us go, I think it's too risky to try to contact him. I'd rather just find a way to get the hell out of here... tell me. Can I count on you to work with me to get out of here? }{I don't know. Even if there is a chance he may be willing to let us go, I think it's too risky to try to contact him. I'd rather just find a way to get the hell out of here... tell me. Can I count on you to work with me to get out of here?}{}{}{}{qu1001 1}
