{500}{[Ares grins at you.] Spectacular! I know we can get this done, working together. I've been hammering at Liebert's security for days now, but I really need more information to obtain access to the security systems. }{[Ares grins at you.] Spectacular! I know we can get this done, working together. I've been hammering at Liebert's security for days now, but I really need more information to obtain access to the security systems.}{}{}{}{}
{501}{Information?}{}{5}{}{505}{}
