{505}{Up on Ground Level, there's a small storage room which contains all the manuals and documentation for the security. I'm no good in a fight or sneaking about, but you look like you could get up there safely...}{Up on Ground Level, there's a small storage room which contains all the manuals and documentation for the security. I'm no good in a fight or sneaking about, but you look like you could get up there safely...}{}{}{}{}
{506}{Alright, I'll give it a try... anything I should know?}{}{5}{}{520}{}
