{520}{Well, last I checked the elevator wasn't even running. So getting to the ground floor won't be easy. You'll either have to restore power to the elevator, or work your way up through the vents and maintenance tunnels. Here's a key I found in the Recovery Chambers. It's labelled "Arms". Sounds like it could be useful, eh?}{Well, last I checked the elevator wasn't even running. So getting to the ground floor won't be easy. You'll either have to restore power to the elevator, or work your way up through the vents and maintenance tunnels. Here's a key I found in the Recovery Chambers. It's labelled "Arms". Sounds like it could be useful, eh?}{}{}{}{in-4602 }
